 "caveats": [
  "survivorship: on-disk panel holds ETFs that still exist",
  "cash earns a flat assumed rate (no 国债逆回购 panel in this repo); the 2% leg is a scenario, not an observed series",
  "k is revised every 20 bars, so the realised beta wanders inside a segment; the expanding beta estimate runs high against the beta that actually shows up, so the overlay delivers ~75% of the requested exposure (a second benchmark at the realised beta is reported for that reason)",
  "expanding-window beta is slow to react; a shorter window would drift more",
  "exploratory: no preregistration, no verdict, no ledger booking"
